desc:Damei Mixing Suite (Pre-Master Channel & Bus DSP)
// Weyland-Yutani / Retro-Futuristic Industrial Console Architecture
// Systematic Mixing Guide + Drum Transient Shaper + Precision Sibilance De-Esser + -6 dBTP Headroom Guardian + 4-Band Tonal Balance Control

slider1:0<0,5,1{Mix Overview,Dynamic EQ & De-Ess,Console Comp & Transients,Color & Tape,Stereo Space,AI Mix Assist}>-Active Module
slider2:0<0,1,1{Off,Run AI Mix Analysis}>-AI Mix Assistant Trigger
slider3:-6.0<-18.0,0.0,0.1>-Headroom Target Ceiling (dBTP)
slider4:1<0,1,1{Off,Strict -6 dBTP Auto-Trim}>-Auto-Headroom Gain Leveler
slider5:0.0<-12.0,12.0,0.1>-Mix Output Trim (dB)
slider6:100<40,250,5>-Sub-Bass Mono-Anchor Cutoff (Hz)
slider7:1.0<0.5,1.5,0.01>-Stereo Dimension Width
slider8:0<0,2,1{British VCA (Punch),Opto 2A (Smooth),FET 76 (Peak Catch)}>-Compressor Topology
slider9:-18.0<-36.0,0.0,0.5>-Mix Bus Comp Threshold (dB)
slider10:2<0,4,1{1.5:1,2:1,4:1,8:1,All-Buttons-In}>-Mix Bus Comp Ratio
slider11:30<0.1,100,0.5>-Comp Attack (ms)
slider12:0<0,5,1{Auto,0.1s,0.3s,0.6s,1.2s,Smooth Dual}>-Comp Release
slider13:105<20,250,5>-Comp Sidechain HPF (Hz)
slider14:0.5<0.0,6.0,0.1>-Comp Make-up Gain (dB)
slider15:100<0,100,1>-Comp Mix (%)
slider16:0.0<-6.0,6.0,0.1>-Spectral Tilt Balance (dB)
slider17:0.0<-12.0,6.0,0.1>-Dynamic De-Box Mud Gain (dB)
slider18:320<150,600,10>-Dynamic De-Box Frequency (Hz)
slider19:0.0<-12.0,6.0,0.1>-Dynamic De-Harsh Gain (dB)
slider20:3800<2000,7000,50>-Dynamic De-Harsh Frequency (Hz)
slider21:0.0<0.0,10.0,0.1>-Analog Harmonic Drive (dB)
slider22:0<0,2,1{Warm Triode Tube,Punchy Pentode,Vintage Tape Saturation}>-Saturation Character
slider23:0<0,1,1{Off,Active Tape De-Esser}>-High-Frequency Tape Sheen / De-Esser
slider24:1<0,3,1{Off,Gentle Optical Crest Rider (+/-1.5dB),Commercial Macro & Micro Mix Rider (+/-2.5dB),Song-Structure Dynamic Crest Inflator (+3.0dB)}>-Dynamic Crest & Internal Automation Rider
slider25:0<0,2,1{Off,Dynamic Mix Bus Spectral Balancer (+/-3.0dB),Active Breakdown De-Mud (+/-4.5dB)}>-Dynamic Mix Bus Spectral Balancer
slider26:-18.0<-24.0,-12.0,0.5>-Analogue 0 VU Target Reference (dBFS RMS)
slider27:0<0,1,1{Manual Staging,Auto-Calibrate to 0 VU (-18 dBFS)}>-Analogue 0 VU Gain Stager
slider28:0<0,2,1{Off,Gentle (-1.8dB Mid Notch),Deep Cut (-3.5dB Mid Notch)}>-Center Vocal Donut-Hole Carver
slider29:2500<1500,4000,50>-Vocal Donut-Hole Center Frequency (Hz)
slider30:0<0,2,1{Off,Fast Notch (190Hz),Heavy Palm-Mute Tamer}>-Guitar Palm-Mute Chug Guard
slider31:190<140,260,5>-Guitar Chug Center Frequency (Hz)
slider32:0<0,1,1{Print Mode (-6.0 dBTP Clean),Audition Mode (-8.5 LUFS Maximizer)}>-Mix Into It Rough Maximizer Preview
slider33:0<0,2,1{Off,Hamidovic Split (Sub DI + Mid Grit),Tractor Grind Aggressive}>-Bass 3-Way Crossover Architecture
slider34:0.0<-6.0,6.0,0.1>-Drum Transient Attack Punch (dB)
slider35:0.0<-6.0,6.0,0.1>-Drum Transient Sustain Tail (dB)
slider36:-18.0<-36.0,0.0,0.5>-Precision De-Esser Threshold (dB)
slider37:6500<4500,9000,100>-Precision De-Esser Center Frequency (Hz)
slider38:0<0,2,1{Off,Split-Band Precision Clamp,Wideband Smooth De-Esser}>-Precision De-Esser Mode
slider39:0<0,24,1{Default Modern Metal Clean (2026 Clarity & Punch),Lance Prenc (Alpha Wolf / Polaris),Scott Seigel (DIESECT),Jonathan Dolese (Mirrorcell / Cane Hill),Buster Odeholm (thrown / Northlane),Lewis Johns (Love Is Noise / blanket),Kel Pinchin (Split Chain),Dan Lancaster & Jason Perry (Don Broco / BMTH),Erik Bickerstaffe (Static Dress / Loathe),Sam Guaiana (Shyeye / Silverstein),Zach Tuch (Heavenward / Hundredth),Forrester Savell (City Of Souls / Karnivool),Leon Schmidt (SUNBORN - Nebula),Ermin Hamidovic Systematic Reference,Will Putney (Fit For An Autopsy / Knocked Loose),George Lever (Loathe / Sleep Token),Sam Bassal (Thornhill - nerv / Ocean Grove),Henrik Udd (Architects - Gravity / Bleed From Within),Dan Braunstein (Spiritbox - Keep Sweet),Zakk Cervini & Erik Ron (Bad Omens - THE DEATH OF PEACE OF MIND),Jens Bogren (Fascination Street Studios),Adam Nolly Getgood (Periphery / GGD),Acle Kahney (TesseracT - King),Adam Cichocki (heaving. - carsick / Timber Studios),Manuel Renner (SENNA - Out Of The Blue / Überlärm Studios)}>-Producer Signature Mix Preset
slider40:0<0,2,1{Transparent Linear Headroom,Smooth Musical Bus Clipper (Lance Prenc),Hard Converter Clip}>-Mix Bus Headroom & Clipping Mode
slider41:0.0<-6.0,6.0,0.1>-Producer Center Vocal Level Trim (dB)
slider42:0<0,3,1{Dry Upfront Punch,Stereo 3D Halo,Ambient Shoegaze Bloom,Vintage Tape Slap}>-Producer Vocal Space & Ambience Halo
slider43:0.0<0.0,6.0,0.1>-Producer Vocal Saturation & Bite (dB)
slider44:1<0,3,1{Off,Tasteful Auto-Impact (+0.10x Width / +0.8dB Punch),Commercial Drop Slam (+0.16x Width / +1.4dB Punch),Subtle Dynamic Breathing (+0.06x Width / +0.4dB Punch)}>-Song Structure & Chorus Impact AI
slider45:0<0,2,1{Hybrid Sensor (Auto-Prioritize REAPER Regions),REAPER Project Markers & Regions (Strict),Autonomous Acoustic AI (Zero Labels Required)}>-Song Structure Detection Mode
slider46:0<0,4,1{Flat (Mix Reference),Car Test (Cabin Acoustics & Glass Reflections),Phone (Mono Small Speaker Bandpass),Club Subwoofer (95Hz Low-Pass Check),Lossy Streaming Codec (AAC/MP3 Test)}>-Monitor Translation Audition

options:gmem=DameiMixMetering
options:no_meter
options:maxmem=2097152
in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

